sentences.text:
It is directed that the petitioner shall be released on bail, subject to the following conditions:-
(i) The petitioner shall execute a bond for a sum of Rs.50,000/-
(Rupees fifty thousand only) with two solvent sureties each for the like sum to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;

(ii) The Petitioner shall report before the Investigating officer in Crime No.1349/2023 of Thrikkodithanam Police Station, Kottayam District at 11.00 am every Saturday till 31-12-2023 and also whenever called upon to do so;
(iii) The petitioner shall not attempt to interfere with the investigation, influence or intimidate the victim/defacto complainant or any witness in Crime No.1349/2023 of Thrikkodithanam Police Station, Kottayam District;
(iv) The petitioner shall not enter the local limits of Thrikkodithanam Police Station, Kottayam District except for the purpose of complying with any condition imposed in this order, till the filing of final report;

